OL,3,GNEWSAEx-England footballer Raheem
OL,4,ASterling to be sentenced for dangerous
OL,5,Adriving
OL,6,
OL,7,FSterling pleaded guilty to driving the
OL,8,Fcar dangerously on the M3, the M25, the
OL,9,FA327 and Minley Road - he also admitted
OL,10,Fpossessing nitrous oxide, a Class C
OL,11,Fdrug, for wrongful inhalation and
OL,12,Ffailing to provide a specimen for
OL,13,Fanalysis
OL,15,FThe footballer has 82 England caps, the
OL,16,Flast of which was won at the 2022 World
OL,17,FCup in Qatar
